    <link>https://www.lemonde.fr/culture/article/2026/05/05/molieres-2026-laurent-laffitte-elsa-lepoivre-et-la-piece-de-theatre-sur-le-combat-de-l-avocate-gisele-halimi-recompenses-lors-de-la-37e-ceremonie_6685486_3246.html</link>
